2026-11-11T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2490) 'What the fabric is for, and what it is not
 # uuid: 2ddd6de8-4f41-5021-b1b2-dc288e9c104a
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:flight-level:l2
 RFD:Discussion  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-11-11T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2490) 'the whole RFD board: its purpose and its non-goals.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2490) 'Does a new RFD on this board serve the open, self-hosted campus, or
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2490) 'does it drift toward a walled garden?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2490) 'The 2020 charter asked for an open, remixable, self-hosted VR space.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2490) 'Most of it still holds. The targets and the trust model have moved on.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2490) 'Check a new idea against the non-goals in the details. A match is
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2490) 'refused, not argued again.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2490) 'Charter digest and board-wide non-goals
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2490) 'We work on the important problem, the one with a reasonable attack,
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2490) 'and we stop work that serves no important problem (Hamming, "You and
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2490) 'Your Research", 1986). We maximize our use cases and minimize our work
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2490) 'and tools (operator, 2026-11-25). Today the important problem is the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2490) 'first beta (RFD66606-2360), set out in the details. The board-wide
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2490) 'non-goals below bind every RFD on this board (operator, 2026-11-11).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2490) '- RFD66606-2360, the campus beta, which points here for its non-goals.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2490) '- RFD66606-2146, bao is the secret store.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2490) '- RFD66606-2202, ReBAC role tuples enforced via Bao identity groups.
