 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2490) '  https://v-sekai.github.io/manuals/decisions/20200608-vsekai-charter.html.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2490) 'The fabric and its first beta
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2490) 'The fabric is an open, remixable, self-hosted collaborative space
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2490) 'built on Godot. Its first beta: two people in one campus zone see each
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2490) 'other's avatars, one on a win64 desktop and one on another
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2490) 'win64 desktop (operator, 2026-11-26). The beta is one
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2490) 'platform, one guest host with one message shape and one build path.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2490) 'The client ships as a win64 ORAS folder and each server as a NixOS
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2490) 'flake container under Ankaios (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2490) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

