 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2490) '(https://v-sekai.github.io/manuals/decisions/20200608-vsekai-charter.html)
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2490) 'set out these intents.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: a remixable, self-hosted, collaborative VR environment on
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2490) '  Godot Engine.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: openness and communication as the basis of the platform.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: an open alternative to walled-garden social VR.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: users keep power over their data and can run the platform
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2490) '  privately.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: easy to compile and modify.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: baseline presence, people in a room who can see each other
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2490) '  (beta 1). Hearing each other rides on the platform as a use case
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2490) '  (RFD66606-2360, operator, 2026-11-25).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Kept: a neutral host for events, and for business meetings where
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2490) '  privacy matters.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Superseded: Windows SteamVR and Oculus Quest as targets. The targets
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-2490) '  are win64 on Windows. The Steam Frame and the Steam Deck were
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2490) '  dropped as targets (operator, 2026-11-26). The Mac is not a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2490) '  target (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Superseded: decentralized authentication through a GPG web of trust.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2490) '  OpenBao is the identity and secret store (operator, 2026-11-11; see
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2490) '  RFD66606-2146 and RFD66606-2202).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Superseded: BitTorrent and IPFS distribution. Content ships from a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2490) '  standard CDN through HTTP range requests, chunked so that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-2490) '  desync-compatible tools can fetch it (operator, 2026-11-11).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Dropped: the 2020 stack (k3s, CentOS 8, Digital Ocean Spaces), the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-2490) '  eight-week Gantt chart, team bios and user-count estimates.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:57Z (RFD66606-2490) '- Not promised here: end-to-end encryption between users. OpenBao does
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:00:58Z (RFD66606-2490) '  not provide it, and nothing in this board commits to it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

