 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-2490) 'A non-goal on this board is abandoned, not deferred. A new RFD that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-11T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-2490) 'matches one is refused, and the list is not argued again.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2490  1 LINE
 Text:Written

